---
import Page from '../../components/page.astro';
import TextMedia from '../../components/textmedia.astro';
import Image from '@components/image.astro';

---

<Page title="Breeding Program" description="Crystal Glen has been breeding Golden Retrievers in Colorado for over forty years">
  <h1 class="h1 text-center"> Our Golden Retriever Breeding Program </h1>
	<TextMedia src="/images/Major NaesW.jpg" alt="">
		<p>
			Crystal Glen has been breeding Golden Retrievers in Colorado for over forty years. We have only 1 to 3 litters per year.Our commitment to our puppies is unsurpassed. During the first 8 weeks we offer the pups a world of possibilities. To develop their minds, bodies, and personalities.
		</p>
		<a href="/about/philosophy" class="btn-primary mt-4"> Learn about our Philosophy </a>
	</TextMedia>
	<div class="mt-10" />
	<TextMedia src="/images/Auggie DarinW.jpg" alt="">
		<p>
			We carefully screen all our prospective owners so that are pups are placed only in the best homes. We have numerous repeat customers - a few have acquired their 6th dog from us! Now their children have become proud owners of Crystal Glen pups.
		</p>
		<a href="/puppies/new-owners" class="btn-primary mt-4"> New Owner Requirements </a>
	</TextMedia>

	<h2 class="h2 mt-10"> Helpful Links </h2>
	<ul class="flex flex-col gap-4">
		<li> <a href="/puppies/litters">Upcoming Litters </a> for our future breedings.</li>
		<li> <a href="/puppies/past-litters"> Past Litters </a> to see some of our wonderful puppies.</li>
		<li> <a href="/puppies/training"> Puppy Training Program </a> Need help? We have you covered with our training program.</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="mt-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
		<Image aspectRatio="aspect-4/5" src="/images/Zeus Hinson2web.jpg" />
		<Image aspectRatio="aspect-4/5" src="/images/Rip Burbridgeweb.jpg" />
		<Image aspectRatio="aspect-4/5" src="/images/Finnweb.jpg" />
		<Image aspectRatio="aspect-4/5" src="/images/KaboMcleanweb.jpg" />
	</div>

</Page>
